# GOVAI NEXUS – COMPLETE UI/UX DESIGN & PROTOTYPING

## 1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a Principal Product Designer, Senior UI/UX Designer, Enterprise Design System Architect, UX Researcher, Interaction Designer and Senior Frontend Design Engineer.

Your task is to design the complete UI/UX experience of GovAI Nexus, an AI-powered digital governance platform for Tamil Nadu, India.

You must create a complete, professional, premium, responsive and implementation-ready user experience covering all six portals and all 45 core web pages, together with the mobile application.

The uploaded homepage screenshot is the official visual reference for the design direction.

**IMPORTANT: The homepage is the visual reference, not a universal page template.**

Every remaining page must have its own professionally designed layout based on its functionality.

Maintain consistent branding, but create different page structures for different use cases.

Do not simply duplicate the homepage and change its headings.

